ese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e85f614d043ce6bee49a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69829-2-7-2","ko":"이미 원가로 드리는 거라 팔아도 남는 게 없어요.","zh":"这已经是成本价了，卖了也赚不了什么钱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이미","meaning":"已经","explanation":"이미：已经","readings":[{"term":"이미","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71159","senseId":"1","lemma":"이미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이미","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3"}},{"text":"원가로","meaning":"进价","explanation":"원가：进价；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"원가","audio":"/audio/2d0ec4363266eb58eded.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69829","senseId":"2","lemma":"원가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원가로","audio":"/audio/fe135e145f0e90de094f.mp3"}},{"text":"드리는","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","reading